          y=985: FD -> Data (rightward, long)
          y=1015: FD -> Volume (rightward, longest)
          Analytics -> Data: routed along x=560 down through y=880 column - needs a different approach
          
          Actually let's use:
          - FD exits right side of box (different x values), uses upper lanes
          - Loan exits bottom (different x), short runs
          - CASA exits bottom (different x), short runs  
          - Analytics exits left side, goes down and around
